  "peptideContentCerebrolysinDescription": "Cerebrolysin è una miscela di peptidi a basso peso molecolare e aminoacidi derivati dal tessuto cerebrale suino. È prescritto in diversi paesi europei e asiatici per indicazioni neurodegenerative e per il recupero dall'ictus.",
  "@peptideContentCerebrolysinDescription": {
    "description": "Educational reference description for Cerebrolysin.",
    "sourceString": "Cerebrolysin is a mixture of low-molecular-weight peptides and amino acids derived from porcine brain tissue. It is prescribed in several European and Asian countries for neurodegenerative and stroke-recovery indications.",
    "sourceDescription": "Educational reference description for Cerebrolysin."
  },
  "peptideContentCerebrolysinTypicalDose": "Fiale da 5–30 ml (ambito clinico)",
  "@peptideContentCerebrolysinTypicalDose": {
    "description": "Reference amount text for Cerebrolysin; this is not a dosing recommendation.",
